# Tasks Generation

## Sizing
- Major tasks: 3-10 sub-tasks.
- Sub-tasks: 1-3 hours of focused work.
- Phases: Foundation → Core → Integration → Validation.

## Annotations
- `_Requirements: 1.1, 1.2_` — numeric IDs only, no descriptions.
- `_Boundary: ComponentName_` — required on `(P)` tasks; matches component names from design.md.
- `_Depends: 3.1, 4.2_` — cross-boundary dependencies only; sequential order is implicit.
- `(P)` — parallel-capable, runs alongside other (P) tasks in different boundaries.

## Avoid
- Generic tasks like "implement the backend".
- File-level instructions like "edit albums.ts".

## Prefer
- Capabilities and outcomes:
  - "Create POST /sessions endpoint with payload validation, 201 response, and 400 for invalid data."
  - "Add a unit test for login lockout after 5 failed attempts."
  - "Add metric auth.login.failed with non-sensitive labels."

## Mechanical Checks
- [ ] Every task carries `_Requirements:_` with numeric IDs only.
- [ ] Every `(P)` task carries `_Boundary:_`.
- [ ] Every `_Depends:_` references a task ID that exists in this file.
- [ ] No two `(P)` tasks share the same boundary.
